{"book":"I Kings","chapter":5,"entries":[{"id":8879,"title":"I Kings 5:1","segments":["¶And Hiram king of Tyre sent his servants unto Solomon; for he had heard that they had anointed him king in the room of his father: for Hiram was ever a lover of David. {Hiram: also called, Huram}"],"ref":"I Kings 5:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And Hiram","strong":"H2438"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Tyre","strong":"H6865"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" his servants","strong":"H5650"},{"text":" unto Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":"; for he had heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" that they had anointed","strong":"H4886"},{"text":" him king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" in the room of his father","strong":"H1"},{"text":": for Hiram","strong":"H2438"},{"text":" was ever","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" a lover","strong":"H157"},{"text":" of David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":". {Hiram: also called, Huram}"}]},{"id":8880,"title":"I Kings 5:2","segments":["And Solomon sent to Hiram, saying,"],"ref":"I Kings 5:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" to Hiram","strong":"H2438"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":","}]},{"id":8881,"title":"I Kings 5:3","segments":["Thou knowest how that David my father could not build an house unto the name of the LORD his God for the wars which were about him on every side, until the LORD put them under the soles of his feet."],"ref":"I Kings 5:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"Thou knowest","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" how that David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" my father","strong":"H1"},{"text":" could","strong":"H3201"},{"text":" not build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" an house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" unto the name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" his God","strong":"H430"},{"text":" for","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the wars","strong":"H4421"},{"text":" which were about him on every side","strong":"H5437"},{"te